TY  - JOUR
ID  - arxiv-1409.2799v2
AU  - ANDERSEN, HENNING HAAHR
AU  - TUBBENHAUER, DANIEL
TI  - DIAGRAM CATEGORIES FOR Uq-TILTING MODULES
DA  - D:20171116
UR  - https://arxiv.org/abs/1409.2799
AB  - We give a diagrammatic presentation of the category of Uq(sl2)-tilting modules T for q being a root of unity and introduce a grading on T. This grading is a “root of unity phenomenon” and might lead to new insights about link and 3-manifold invariants deduced from T. We also give a diagrammatic category for the (graded) projective endofunctors on T, indicate how our results could generalize and collect some “well-known” facts to give a reasonably self-contained exposition.
ER  - 
